              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Danielle"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I took the advice of the person who suggested replacing the milk with more cream, and this was AWESOME. It was so perfect. I folded in some raspberries that I tossed in sugar, and used this as a filling for a layer cake. I will definitely use this recipe again. Thanks!"
          },
